silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_03_bridge_to_crdt_convergence_concrete_anchor_replica_product a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.03_bridge_to_crdt_convergence.concrete_anchor.replica_product" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_03_bridge_to_crdt_convergence_concrete_anchor_replica_product silm:hasLongDescription "The ReplicaPairForMittensVetRecord is R_i x R_j is the pair of replica states — R_i holds Mittens's vaccination history, R_j holds Mittens's weight measurements. Both are about Mittens. The product node represents the inputs to the gossip merge." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_03_bridge_to_crdt_convergence_concrete_anchor_merged_replica a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.03_bridge_to_crdt_convergence.concrete_anchor.merged_replica" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_03_bridge_to_crdt_convergence_concrete_anchor_merged_replica silm:hasLongDescription "The GossipMergedVetRecord is R_i join R_j is the merged state after GossipMerge — contains both vaccination history and weight measurements for Mittens. This is the direct sum in the CRDT semilattice. It is NOT Mittens itself; it is the merged storage state that carries the aboutness arrow to Mittens." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_03_bridge_to_crdt_convergence_concrete_anchor_mittens_apex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.03_bridge_to_crdt_convergence.concrete_anchor.mittens_apex" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_03_bridge_to_crdt_convergence_concrete_anchor_mittens_apex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensGovernedIndividualApex is Mittens is the cocone apex — the governed individual that both R_i x R_j and R_i join R_j are about. The aboutness arrows from both replica product and merged state to Mittens must commute. This is NOT the storage state — it is the semantic colimit apex that the storage states are about." .
